        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord &quot;Touhou Witch's Night Market Community&quot; for discussing！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰️ REPAY THE DEBT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa had sold all her magical items to raise money for 'Kappachinko'... Unfortunately she lost everything in it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by addiction, Marisa had stolen all across Gensokyo, even took on a malicious loan from Reimu! With no other choice, she's forced to join the magical item battles that was trending in Gensokyo, hoping to earn enough to repay her debts and escape from Reimu's relentless pursuit…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her sharp intuition for magical items, she believes she can defeat all opponents. But... will things really go as she hopes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤓 BUILD YOUR CONSTRUCT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Marisa, collect items and skills to build your own construct, then try to defeat the opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a total of 158 items and 69 skills, each with its own unique attributes and effects. Unleash your creativity and combine them into powerful constructs! You might even discover new combinations that the dev team never imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game lasts only around 15 minutes. Keep challenging and see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⏱️TIME TO FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is divided into 10 days , with each day split into 4 moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the daytime, You will encounter various events, where you can purchase items, learn skills, gain exp, fight random enemies, or even change the effect of an item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will visit the night market and meet other Touhou charaters who specialize in different weapons (we won't spoil who they are, but let's just say you might run into Koishi, Remilia or Reisen). Choose who you want to talk to, then challenge and defeat them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to survive until the end of Day 10, you will step into the 11th day where an unexpected challenge awaits. Overcome this mysterious being and then you can—</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔓️ UNLOCK EXTRA MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the game several times on Lunatic difficulty to unlock EXTRA MODE, where you're able to challenge your historical data!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode also allows you to import other players' data. Share your save files with your friends and let them try to defeat your construct! But don't celebrate too soon—No matter how powerful your construct seems, there will always be a strategy that can counter it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE THINGS...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the background! Decorate it with your favorite Touhou Character's stickers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the memes and other touhou references hidden in the dialogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the Meboxen club on the homepage to read messages left by devs and fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still many secrets waiting for you in Touhou Witch's Night Market...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord &quot;Touhou Witch's Night Market Community&quot; for discussing！</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord &quot;Touhou Witch's Night Market Community&quot; for discussing！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/f25b02735f224dc1f60475d1330843cd.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰️ REPAY THE DEBT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa had sold all her magical items to raise money for 'Kappachinko'... Unfortunately she lost everything in it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by addiction, Marisa had stolen all across Gensokyo, even took on a malicious loan from Reimu! With no other choice, she's forced to join the magical item battles that was trending in Gensokyo, hoping to earn enough to repay her debts and escape from Reimu's relentless pursuit…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her sharp intuition for magical items, she believes she can defeat all opponents. But... will things really go as she hopes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤓 BUILD YOUR CONSTRUCT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Marisa, collect items and skills to build your own construct, then try to defeat the opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a total of 158 items and 69 skills, each with its own unique attributes and effects. Unleash your creativity and combine them into powerful constructs! You might even discover new combinations that the dev team never imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game lasts only around 15 minutes. Keep challenging and see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/52e276cd22df488f2d95d4cbc23c763f.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⏱️TIME TO FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is divided into 10 days , with each day split into 4 moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the daytime, You will encounter various events, where you can purchase items, learn skills, gain exp, fight random enemies, or even change the effect of an item!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, you will visit the night market and meet other Touhou charaters who specialize in different weapons (we won't spoil who they are, but let's just say you might run into Koishi, Remilia or Reisen). Choose who you want to talk to, then challenge and defeat them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to survive until the end of Day 10, you will step into the 11th day where an unexpected challenge awaits. Overcome this mysterious being and then you can—</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔓️ UNLOCK EXTRA MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the game several times on Lunatic difficulty to unlock EXTRA MODE, where you're able to challenge your historical data!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode also allows you to import other players' data. Share your save files with your friends and let them try to defeat your construct! But don't celebrate too soon—No matter how powerful your construct seems, there will always be a strategy that can counter it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.poster.avif?t=1781625932\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.webm?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950050/extras/6a491c66d1228e2a18d57f986a0ebd26.mp4?t=1781625932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE THINGS...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the background! Decorate it with your favorite Touhou Character's stickers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the memes and other touhou references hidden in the dialogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the Meboxen club on the homepage to read messages left by devs and fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still many secrets waiting for you in Touhou Witch's Night Market...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord &quot;Touhou Witch's Night Market Community&quot; for discussing！</strong></p>",
